  "memo": "R03 establishes the Card family. No other adverse family is present, and no earlier outcome settles the order. Historical address sharing does not establish current Linkage; no household exception is needed. Row §6.6(b) initially required id_check, but its failed outcome now mandates decline under §5.3(b). Escalation is prohibited without Linkage. A legitimate customer using an established foreign-issued card remains a competing explanation, but prior repayment does not identify the current purchaser or override verification failure. The order is unshipped, so decline voids and refunds it and blocks the account. No further check would change the policy disposition."
